Gonna keep this as short as I can (I tend to talk too much), I'm proud
of this enough to post but it's not impressive enough for a huge
writeup (by my standards anyway).

Started this character out only intending to keep athiest. Found a
magic lamp in minetown, intending to wish for the Eye of the
Aethiopica, got "You freed me!" Fell into a trap door in minetown (was
gonna head to sokoban), found a bones pile with a used up magic
marker, cursed gloves of dex, cursed comr, cursed helm of telepathy,
empty?? uncursed bag of holding (my second, there was another in
minetown). Poor guy had been killed by a chameleon-salamander. I had a
couple dogs at this point and cleared it easily. Still hadn't seen a
remove curse scroll though; I ended up wearing all the armor cursed
which sucked because helm of telepathy inhibits casting. I ended up
swapping the [omr and my starting robe. Uncursed the [omr with an unid
80zm scroll which turned out to be enchant armor. Also got a magic
whistle.

Went and did sokoban, got a third boh. Sigh. Set up my stash there.
Went back into the mines, found a poly trap. Got an arch lich, a titan
(named it Hyperion), fire giant, baby gray dragon (the bones pile cat
became this). Also charmed a baby purple worm in mines end. I couldn't
keep an arch-lich tame in an earlier game, it killed me, so I dumped
it below my polymachine. Tamed another dog in minetown, it became a
master lich (wtf?) dumped it too. Above minetown a chameleon turned
into an archlich, I was afraid it was my first archlich who had
stepped in a level teleporter, I had a genocide scroll so I just
killed L to be done with it.

Anyway, things went along, cleared outer Ludios, found +5 studded
leather but no scales (any color). Did quest easily, was XL13 after
ludios, then drank 2 gain level potions. Holy crap priest quest has a
lot of monsters. Somehow got lucky and gained 6 levels from wraiths.
On way to medusa, swampy level, opened a door, typed too quickly and
didn't realize I was trapped and jumped in the water. Didn't lose
anything tooooo huge but lost a charging scroll and my identify
spellbook. Got to Medusa, hostile titan summoned nasties, I put on
conflict to not die and my dragon got stoned. Eventually cleared
everything and my titan survived, found a 0:88 magic marker in the
wreckage. I immediately used it to kill h, ;, R. Got to castle wand
with a bugle by digging (still no lev). At this point I still had all
5 conducts so I said lets see if I can do this, threw the wand of
wishing in my sack and revgenoed silver dragons in the wand room. I
knew I would never be able to afford rewriting the ID book without a
wish or another dropped marker but I had only gotten it recently so I
wasn't too worried.

Anyway, pretty straightforward from here, genocided mimics and found
speed boots, rings of free action and levitation, and an amulet of
life saving in orcustown. Charmed another titan that spawned in
Vlad's, and two purple worms. Never did find +oRC or +oMM, mapped the
whole thing manually. Also never found =oTC, so I stayed away from t-
itis. Carried around buckets of teleport scrolls the whole game that
never got used. Found a hawaiian shirt in molochs off an align priest.

I gotta say, trying to get out of gehennom with 4 pets (two titans,
two level 30 purple worms, yum moloch's) is really annoying. VicViper
suggested dropping the amulet so I didnt have to get them all to go up
at once and that made it a lot easier... but halfway up one of the
worms ate a Green Slime :(

Plane of Earth was annoying, it was hard to line up rodney in a way
that wouldnt kill my pet with /oDeath because he summoned nasties and
then double troubled. Stole both the amulet and the mitre of holiness,
but eventually we  (reinforced by an olog-hai I picked up on the way
back up) killed everything. Found portal, and typed too quickly...
left all my pets behind in the plane of earth. NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO

Found the portal in air, was almost there when I saw an archon. Looked
up it's MR, only 80... could be worse, I had 300 MP, I'll give it a
shot. At 110 I gave up... but then it summoned nasties. I figured the
easiest way out (despite wearing conflict) would be to charm again, at
least i can then just displace my way out, but that time I got the
archon! wooooooooooooo

Plane of water, I vowed not to make the same mistake again as earth so
I took my "oLS off and put "oYendor on. Was moving pretty slowly and
magic whistling every so often. I was pretty sure I was near the
portal but I wasn't getting hot/cold so I wasn't moving that slowly...
then got "you have activated a portal!" are you kidding me? So the
archon got left behind.

Astral, found famine, he was on the right, I had less food than I like
to fight him with so I went up the middle. Killed pestilence, as I was
approaching the altar I realized I forgot the name of my god... lol
Athiest. But : tells you the alignment also, and I had gotten it on my
first try!

durron597, neutral female human Priestess




